I learnt how to manage files and directories using the Linux command line.

I learnt how to:

Create files using touch
Create directories using mkdir
Copy files and directories using cp
Move and rename files using mv
Delete files using rm
Remove empty directories using rmdir
View file contents using cat and less
Search for files using find
Use wildcards such as * and ? to work with multiple filenames
Understand the difference between files and directories
Navigate directories and manage their contents from the terminal.
